# Key File Locations

When you need to understand existing patterns, reference these files:

- Architecture entry: `src/http-app/http-app.module.ts`
- Example domain module: `src/domain/compass/` (most complete)
- AI facade: `src/ai/ai.facade.ts` and `src/ai/ai-real.facade.ts`
- Building blocks: `src/building-blocks/` (Entity, BusinessRule, etc.)
- Prompt templates: `prompts/` directory (Handlebars .hbs files)
- Config: `src/config/config.ts` (ConfigProvider)
- Migrations: `src/migrations/`
- E2E test infra: `test/helpers/` (TestAppFactory, AppContainersFactory)

Always read existing implementations before creating new ones. Match the patterns exactly.
